"
TALLY PROGRAM (NEURON ESOTERIC PROGRAMMING LANGUAGE)
"
Limit,|             "Read an integer and assign the cell its absolute value."
[                   "Start the loop."
    .               "Print the current value."
    ?-              "Pause and then subtract 1 from the cell's value."
]                   "If the current cell isn't 0, go back to the start."

"Try running:" "python main.py tally.n --tape 1"